  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Turn On Your Lovelight//** (1 review): Pigpen begins vocals off-key or in the wrong inversion relative to the band's riff [4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Return The Scratcher**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1968-06-08.158612.remaster.disk4.danielfutureanimation02.flac1644** (recommended): soundboard; 9 songs; 75 min; rated 3/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: The opening of the first set recording exhibits variable tape speed issues [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Bobby performs the introductory lyrics for the first set version of the song [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1968-06-08.158612.remaster.disk4.danielfutureanimation02.flac1644**: source: SBD > Unlabeled Master 7\" Vault Reels > Cassette > DAT [48k] > CDR Original Conversion: CDR > EAC(secure) > Cool Edit(minor cleanup) > mkwact(seekable)… [1]. Also: Jesse Jarnow provided updated information, and the tape flip overlap was corrected [1]",
